# Web Coding Style

## File Organization

Organize by feature or surface area, not by file type (`web/src/components/<feature>/`,
`web/src/lib/`, `web/src/styles/`).

## CSS Custom Properties

Define design tokens as variables. Do not hardcode palette, typography, or spacing repeatedly:

```css
:root {
  --color-surface: oklch(98% 0 0);
  --color-text: oklch(18% 0 0);
  --color-accent: oklch(68% 0.21 250);

  --text-base: clamp(1rem, 0.92rem + 0.4vw, 1.125rem);
  --text-hero: clamp(3rem, 1rem + 7vw, 8rem);

  --space-section: clamp(4rem, 3rem + 5vw, 10rem);

  --duration-normal: 300ms;
  --ease-out-expo: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}
```

## Animation-Only Properties

Prefer compositor-friendly motion: `transform`, `opacity`, `clip-path`, `filter` (sparingly).
Avoid animating `width`, `height`, `top`, `left`, `margin`, `padding`, `border`, `font-size`.

## Semantic HTML First

Use `<header>`, `<nav aria-label>`, `<main>`, `<section aria-labelledby>`, `<footer>` rather than
generic wrapper `div` stacks.

## Naming

- Components: PascalCase (`ProjectCard.astro`)
- Hooks: `use` prefix
- CSS classes: kebab-case or utility classes
